menu "c6_led (WS2812 status indicator)"

    config C6_LED_ENABLE
        bool "Enable WS2812 status LED patterns"
        default y
        help
            One addressable RGB LED (WS2812) driven by RMT on a single GPIO.
            The app state machine maps transitions onto patterns: boot=white
            slow blink, factory_wait=yellow double-blink, net_start=blue 2 Hz,
            online=green heartbeat (normal operation), net failure=red 4 Hz.

    config C6_LED_GPIO
        int "WS2812 data GPIO"
        default 8
        range 0 30
        help
            ESP32-C6-DevKitC-1 wires the onboard WS2812 to GPIO8.  GPIO8 is a
            strapping pin (sampled at reset); driving it after boot is safe.

endmenu
